WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.588
Step seven. Early payoff, and the lien release.

2
00:00:03.588 --> 00:00:11.336
To pay off early, open Early payoff. The quote is your loan balance plus interest, which grows by the second.

3
00:00:11.336 --> 00:00:21.047
So you approve a cap: the balance plus one month of interest. When the transaction runs, the vault charges the exact amount owed. Tap Pay off.

4
00:00:21.047 --> 00:00:28.859
Paid off. The exact amount went to the lender, and the rest of the cap came straight back to you, in the same transaction.

5
00:00:28.859 --> 00:00:35.668
Next, the seller or lender taps Attest lien released, to confirm the lien on the asset is cleared.

6
00:00:35.668 --> 00:00:41.539
The vault then returns your down payment, plus any unswept yield. The deal is closed.

